_:genid13 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> _:genid14 .
_:genid14 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/spot#hasAxis> .
_:genid13 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/spot#EntitySpace> .
_:genid12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:genid11 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasSourceAxis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies which Entity Axis/Source axis is being mapped. Only Axes from Entity Spaces should be in the range of this property."@en .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasSourceAxis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has source axis"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasSourcePoint
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasSourcePoint> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasSourcePoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/spot/am#BoundaryPointMapping> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasSourcePoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/spot/am#BoundaryPoint> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasSourcePoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies which EntityAxis/ Source boundary point is being mapping"@en .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasSourcePoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has source point"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasTargetAxis
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasTargetAxis> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasTargetAxis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/spot/am#AxisMapping> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasTargetAxis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/spot#Axis> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasTargetAxis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies to which target axis the source axis is mapped. The target axis must be from another space instance as the source axis."@en .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#hasTargetAxis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has target axis"@en .
