# https://w3id.org/spot/am#Approximate
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#Approximate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#Approximate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/spot/am#Accuracy> .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#Approximate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Approximate accuracy level for axis mapping. The axes are almost parallel to each other."@en .
<https://w3id.org/spot/am#Approximate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Approximate"@en .
